      "message": "Just a side note, I didn\u0027t know modifiers apply recursively. From https://golang.org/pkg/fmt:\n\n\"For compound operands such as slices and structs, the format applies to the elements of each operand, recursively, not to the operand as a whole. Thus %q will quote each element of a slice of strings, and %6.2f will control formatting for each element of a floating-point array.\"",
